			"notes": "## PlayClock 1.2.0\n\n- Added shareable playtime cards:\n  - per-server and per-world summary cards;\n  - weekly recap cards;\n  - monthly recap cards;\n  - PNG saving and clipboard copy support.\n- Added weekly/monthly recap stats: daily chart, active days, streaks, top target, and period comparison.\n- Added customizable card accent colors with 10 presets.\n- Added reliable singleplayer playtime saving and better handling of world loading/autosave stalls.\n- Fixed Minecraft `1.21.11` world list overlay: total world playtime and hover details now work correctly.\n- Added 2 new UI color presets: `Amethyst` and `Cyberlime`.\n- Verified builds for `1.21.11` and `26.1.x`."
		},
